title: "Direction Engine (direction-drift)"
abstract: >-
  A direction-drift detection engine for AI agents, together with a
  zero-dependency multi-node coexistence layer and an output-provenance
  labelling layer for valid inference. It only surfaces, never auto-corrects:
  alerts belong to the engine, decisions belong to humans.
